Sign in with ChatGPT using a device code:

1. Open this link on any device and sign in:
https://auth.example.com/codex/device

2. Enter this one-time code (expires in 15 minutes):
ABCD-EFGH

Continue only if you started this login in Codex. If a website or another person
gave you this code, cancel.
Waiting for sign-in. Use /login cancel to cancel or /login device to request a
new code.
